{
  "slug": "acuris",
  "name": "Acuris",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Two model-invoked skills for the Acuris APIs. `acuris-address` teaches the Acuris Address Validation & Geocoding SDK (`@acuris-geo/av-sdk`) — validate, geocode,\n  reverse, autocomplete — plus React component recipes for Next.js, Centra, commercetools, and SCAYLE storefronts, plus migration recipes from libAddressDoctor\n  (Informatica), Loqate, Experian QAS, Melissa, and Smarty. `acuris-eudi` teaches relying-party integration with the Acuris EUDI Wallet Verifier (OID4VP / SD-JWT VC\n  at eudi.acuris-geo.com), covering session lifecycle, polling, and trust validation across EU 27 member-state TSLs. Each skill auto-activates only when your task\n  mentions its area, so installing both costs almost no context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `acuris-address` (Acuris Address Validation & Geocoding APIs), `acuris-eudi` (Acuris EUDI Wallet Verifier — a hosted OID4VP relying-party service at https://eudi.acuris-geo.com that accepts EU Digital Identity Wallet…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install acuris@claude-community` from `Acuris-GmbH/acuris-agent-context`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
